window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The truth about Silvergate burns like enchanted silver against vampire skin.</b></p> <p>My blood holds the key to something so valuable that ancient powers would sacrifice anything to possess it. Even me.</p> <p>But my power was never meant to be a weapon. It was meant to be a sanctuary.</p> <p>As rival forces converge on what I've become, I realize the true nature of defence isn't about walls or shields or protection spells.</p> <p>It's about deciding who deserves to survive—and who doesn't.</p> <p><i>This dark paranormal romance is book three in a reverse harem romance series by </i>USA Today <i>bestselling author Eve Newton. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
